---
description: Rules for agent-facing tool surface
globs: packages/mcp/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Keep the tool surface small, typed, and reversible.
- `DIORAMAI_MCP_TOOL_NAMES` in `packages/mcp/src/index.ts` is the canonical tool
  list; `docs/mcp-tools.md` documents payloads.
- Stdio proxies (`scripts/dioramai-mcp.ts`, `dioramai mcp`) must expose exactly
  the tools in `DIORAMAI_MCP_TOOL_DEFINITIONS`; never define ad-hoc tool lists.
- Never expose shell, file read/write, generic `apply_command`/
  `apply_command_batch`, or asset generation tools
  (`DIORAMAI_MCP_FORBIDDEN_CAPABILITIES`).
- Validate all payloads before execution.
- Support preview/dry-run flows where possible.
- Never allow direct hidden state mutation.
